    "enUS": {
      "description": "Unfortunately I haven't had much luck with identifying the ring's owner to bring closure to their family.\r\n\r\nPerhaps Daythor can be of assistance. He knew the others of our regiment quite well.\r\n\r\nI only hope it does not bring back unpleasant memories...",
      "summary": "Show the ring to Daythor Brellan.",
      "title": "Belle's Ring",
